{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-23","kind":"proposition","title":"在给定点复制一个角","englishTitle":"On a given straight line and at a point on it to construct a rectilineal angle equal to a given rectilineal angle.","book":1,"number":23,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.23","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.23/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":23,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","contentId":"euclid-1-23","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6139f5cd848799870c16980f6ad92b7d1cd2e853105ceb20f2cbc46e86867bb0","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-23.statement","euclid-1-23.construction.1","euclid-1-23.proof.1","euclid-1-23.proof.2","euclid-1-23.proof.3","euclid-1-23.proof.4","euclid-1-23.conclusion","euclid-1-23.historical.1","euclid-1-23.historical.2","euclid-1-23.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-23.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed970275e58a1a35d3bbfe72ec358f85b85c29dee35fe625343674221f867790","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On a given straight line and at a point on it to construct a rectilineal angle equal to a given rectilineal angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一个指定的直线上,在它的某个点上,构建一个直线角,等于一个特定的直线角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任于一点上求作一角与所设角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一条直线上，找到一个角并在任意点设定角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26b9df746a2af0b67499676c4cffaf4e1f7c1b28e17b988c8cb0a9269a40272b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given straight line, A the point on it, and the angle DCE the given rectilineal angle;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB是给定的直线,让A是给定的直线点,让DCE是给定的直线角;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a7eeed5ce9a7c27e259306e73b90e9efae5a1a11a72aa0b16348a9f4abb0189","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"thus it is required to construct on the given straight line AB, and at the point A on it, a rectilineal angle equal to the given rectilineal angle DCE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,必须在给定的直线AB上,并在该直线的A点上,建造一个直线角,等于给定的直线角DCE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7096dd5e2c11a8bedf0a49c8493edb368460bbed0c38ef902a2b4806a8607659","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On the straight lines CD, CE respectively let the points D, E be taken at random; let DE be joined, and out of three straight lines which are equal to the three straight lines CD, DE, CE let the triangle AFG be constructed in such a way that CD is equal to AF, CE to AG, and further DE to FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线CD,CE,允许随机选取D,E点;将DE点合用,在相当于3条直线CD,DE,CE直线中,将三角AFG的构造方式改为CD等于AF,CE至AG,再加DE至FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9460bac03a0f63b92c5044107f306dd2e8d73115c17bc1eb2ba6b2ae07aa800","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the two sides DC, CE are equal to the two sides FA, AG respectively, and the base DE is equal to the base FG, the angle DCE is equal to the angle FAG. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"双方DC、CE等值FA、AG,底边、DE等值底边、FG,DCE等值FAG。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0097b2d59bf0476e4f814d5e98b9077ed566a3b35530fe8956d4eb4fccf918e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore on the given straight line AB, and at the point A on it, the rectilineal angle FAG has been constructed equal to the given rectilineal angle DCE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的直线AB和A点,直线角FAG的构造等于给定的直线角DCE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d74d09ae41029b75de807c70f39426e153168cf18f043f0d8a89dfe1f292228a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任于一点上求作一角与所设角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一条直线上，找到一个角并在任意点设定角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"540da52b69e103f5dc273d8f44f55503d9c7ac14e661f899a18e4907d88da450","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙线于丙点求作一角与丁戊己角等先于戊丁线任取一点为庚于戊巳线任取一点为辛自庚至辛作直线次依甲乙线作丙壬癸角形与戊庚辛角形等〈本篇卄二〉即丙壬丙癸两腰与戊庚戊辛两腰等壬癸底与庚辛底又等则丙角与戊角必等〈本篇八〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：对于线段 甲乙，在点 丙 处，画一个等于 丁戊己 的角。在 戊丁 线之前，任意选择一点为 庚，并在 戊巳 线上选择任意一点为 辛。从 庚 画一条直线到 辛，然后根据 甲乙 画出等于 戊庚辛 和 戊庚辛 处的三角形。〈本篇卄二〉 表示 丙壬丙癸 和 戊庚戊辛 的两条边相等。如果 壬癸 和 庚辛 的底边相等，则 丙 和 戊 的角度也必须相等。〈本篇八〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-23.source","contentId":"euclid-1-23","revisionId":"euclid-1-23@raw-6139f5cd84879987","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3b071983857d27a16251711b4f4f1d8c6bf5e2c7e23508837f6b2d5fbe18358","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"p